.SS godot\-cli scene connection
Signal connections stored in the scene ([connection] sections)
.PP
The editor's Node dock writes a [connection] section per connected
signal. These commands read and write the same sections, so
a button wired here shows connected in the editor and needs
no _ready() code.
.SS godot\-cli scene connection list
List signal connections with from/to as viewport paths
.TP
\fIfile\fR
Scene file (.tscn)
.SS godot\-cli scene connection add
Connect a signal from one node to a method on another
.PP
Both nodes must exist. Fails with DuplicateConnection if the
same signal, nodes, and method are already connected.
.TP
