.SS godot\-cli scene instance
Add instanced PackedScene nodes
.SS godot\-cli scene instance add
Instance a PackedScene under a parent node
.PP
Adds ext_resource type=PackedScene and a node with instance=ExtResource(...).
Use \-\-scene or \-\-catalog\-id (project entries only).
.TP
\fIfile\fR
Scene file (.tscn)
.TP
\fB\-\-parent\fR \fIvalue\fR
Viewport parent path (e.g. /root/Main)
.TP
