"A", "physical": true}]}]}, "autoload": {"autoloads": [{"name":
"GameState", "path": "res://scripts/game_state.gd", "singleton":
true}]}, "physics": {"engine_3d": "Jolt Physics"}}. Each section
takes the same document as the matching project <section> apply
command. Give it as a file (\-\-intent) or inline (\-\-intent\-json).
